{{Classic Era}}The Western Plains of Karana offer a route from Qeynos Hills to the east, south and beyond. There is one major path, but one must be wary as bandits have been known to lie in wait for the unsuspecting traveller.

A river forms the southern boundary of the zone, and mountains the northern boundary. Up north hides a camp of ogres and bandits deep in the hills. The southwest has a camp of enterprising barbarians, as well as the creeping hordes of undead that are slowly spreading over the land. Bandits are also trying to reclaim this zone as theirs as well, but with two watch towers keeping a vigilant eye on the comings and goings of this vast land, their presence is scattered at best. 

